      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "When a customer initiates a refund request for a consumable in-app purchase or auto-renewable subscription, the App Store sends a `CONSUMPTION_REQUEST` `notificationType` to your server. The notification includes the `consumptionRequestReason` in the `data` object.",
